          "type": "quote",
          "text": "\"旅客可由高鐵台南站2樓通廊到沙崙火車站，轉乘臺鐵沙崙線往臺南、永康等站。\" — THSR's official note: use the 2F walkway at THSR Tainan to reach Shalun Station and change to the TRA Shalun Line toward Tainan and Yongkang."
